  "description": "FINAL UNIT REMAINING\n\nClós na Croise, Ballivor: Rent-to-Own Opportunity\n\nHomely are bringing to the market this newly refurbished 3-Bedroom apartment available in Clós na Croise, Ballivor, Co. Meath available immediately through our innovative rent-to-own model. Rent-to-Own offers a clear and accessible pathway to homeownership for those seeking long-term security near Dublin and the wider Midlands.\n\nEarly application is strongly advised to secure your place.\n\n----REGISTER YOUR INTEREST HERE----\n\nhttps://ownhomely.com/meath/\n______________________________________________________________\n\nKey Highlights (Rent-to-Own Model)\n\n- Home Type: 3-Bedroom ground floor apartment with own-door access and parking\n\n- Timing: Available for immediate move-in.\n\n- Location: Ballivor, Co. Meath – a thriving village with amenities within walking distance and good commuting access to Dublin.\n\n- Model: Rent-to-Own (3- or 5-year tenancy agreement with a legal right to buy).\n\nKey Features\n\n- Monthly Payments: Rents starting from €1,450 (2-Bed) to €1,850 (3-Bed), plus purchase option payments of €300–€500 that secure your right to future ownership (subject to application).\n\n- Upfront payment of c. 2.5% of current property value with a clear, secure rent-to-own path.\n\n- RTB registered tenancy agreement with legal right to buy in as little as 3 years (5 and 7 years also available).\n\n- BER B-rated construction for warmth, comfort, and low running costs.\n\n- Option for home to be furnished or unfurnished.\n\n- Full support provided by Homely, including mortgage coaching from Engage Financial Services (www.efs.ie) to prepare you for a successful mortgage application.\n\nWhy Clós na Croise, Ballivor?\n\n- A real alternative to endless renting, with a secure route to ownership.\n- Large, pet-friendly home designed for modern living.\n- Energy-efficient design that keeps bills low.\n- Support every step of the way, from move-in to mortgage-ready.\n\nHomely have partnered with Sherry FitzGerald Royal. \n\nNext Steps\nLearn more and register your interest today via the link below and start your journey to ownership.\n\nAPPLICATION LINK:\n\nhttps://ownhomely.com/meath/",
